{
  "name": "l0_named_think_context_storage",
  "about": "Storage-only r024a: CBaseEntity::GetIndexForContext 0x100ac250 uses first case-sensitive strncmp(...,32); RegisterThinkContext 0x100ac360 returns a hit unchanged or appends the caller's name pointer and zero callback/next/last words. Constructed grow size is 0 (0x1009d980), logical capacity grows 2,4,8 via 0x100b49b0. Controlled fixture setup registers Alpha, Beta, a duplicate, lower-case alpha, two 33-byte names sharing 32 bytes, a NUL-shorter prefix, and a longer Alpha name. The caller then mutates its first buffer Alpha->Gamma: Gamma must resolve to 0 and Alpha to -1. The untouched entity proves the empty branch. No current-context or stamp is fabricated; this record proves storage mechanics only. GetLastThink/live dispatch and the original l0_named_think_contexts record remain open. A later Gamma is registered at index 6 before mutation, so lookup Gamma choosing index 0 proves first-match priority over an actual second matching record.",
